 * library-owned rules split out of features/_library.tcss + features/_library_panels.tcss
 * by build_css.py (TASK-25812/TASK-24459). Loaded via the owning screen's
 * CSS_PATH, so these bytes are parsed on first visit instead of before
 * first paint. Edit features/_library.tcss + features/_library_panels.tcss and re-run build_css.py.
 * ======================================== */

